neutral05 #f4f7fd  rgba(2,5,11,1)      -> rgba(15,22,37,1)     <- theme backgroundColor
neutral10 #e8ebf0  rgba(15,18,23,1)    -> rgba(32,35,41,1)
neutral20 #cfd2d7  rgba(40,43,48,1)    -> rgba(54,57,60,1)
neutral30 #b7b9be  rgba(65,67,72,1)    -> rgba(76,77,80,1)     <- border
neutral50 #86878c  rgba(115,116,121,1) -> rgba(118,118,121,1)
neutral70 #54555a  rgba(165,166,171,1) -> rgba(160,160,163,1)  <- secondary / axisLine
neutral80 #3c3c41  rgba(190,190,195,1) -> rgba(180,180,184,1)  <- primary
neutral90 #232328  rgba(215,215,220,1) -> rgba(200,200,206,1)
neutral99 #000     rgba(255,255,255,1) -> rgba(235,235,235,1)
```
Accents (`s*0.5, min(1,1.3-l)` -> `s*0.5, invertLightness(l,0.32,0.88)`):
```
accent05 rgba(68,76,107,1)   -> rgba(68,76,108,1)    (unchanged by design)
accent10 rgba(78,87,119,1)   -> rgba(75,83,113,1)
accent20 rgba(94,107,147,1)  -> rgba(83,94,129,1)
accent30 rgba(119,130,166,1) -> rgba(93,105,144,1)
accent40 rgba(145,154,184,1) -> rgba(105,116,157,1)
accent50 rgba(175,181,201,1) -> rgba(123,132,165,1)
accent70 rgba(238,239,243,1) -> rgba(161,167,186,1)
accent80 rgba(255,255,255,1) -> rgba(178,182,198,1)  <- was clipped
accent90 rgba(255,255,255,1) -> rgba(195,198,211,1)  <- was clipped
accent95 rgba(255,255,255,1) -> rgba(204,206,217,1)  <- was clipped
```
The lower bound `0.32` was chosen so accent05 reproduces today's `rgba(68,76,107)` exactly (`1.3 - 0.957 = 0.343`), i.e. the subtle end of the accent ramp is visually preserved and only the previously-clipped bright end changes shape.

