## Summary of the bug

`src/theme/dark.ts` has a `matrix` block whose keys do NOT match `MatrixOption`. Two of the three entries are dead options, and the body/corner cells + divider lines are never themed at all, so in dark mode they keep the light-mode token values baked into `MatrixModel`'s `defaultOption` (dark-gray label text on a near-black background, light-gray cell borders).

